
# One ordering, most significant first. `rise` ascends and `fall` descends.
#
#   sort fall, read self/frequency
#   sort rise, read self/symbol
#
# Four letters, like every other head in the language. The long pair appears once in the whole tree, inside a
# comment. A sort key must be indexed, for the same reason a predicate must, and the catalog says which are.

load @term/mill/code/view/seed/mine
  find view-seed-read

mine view-sort
  mine term, term sort
    site way
    mine form, like view-seed-read
      site road
